Flipper Zero LTO CM Reader

This project uses the public Flipper Zero firmware application APIs and is designed
to run on Flipper Zero hardware. Flipper Zero and the upstream firmware are projects
of Flipper Devices Inc.

Protocol research was informed by publicly available LTO cartridge-memory work in
philpem/nfc-ltocm and the Proxmark3 community implementation.

No upstream firmware source tree or third-party reference implementation is included
in this repository.
